---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-hora-mundial" set:html={`
<div class="wrap hero"><div><div class="crumb">Viajes / Hora mundial</div><div class="eyebrow">Dos ciudades, un mismo momento</div><h1>La hora de allá, sin hacer cuentas.</h1><p class="lead">Compará husos horarios, coordiná una llamada o calculá a qué hora local aterriza tu vuelo.</p><div class="chips"><span class="chip">✓ Cambio de fecha</span><span class="chip">✓ Horario laboral</span><span class="chip">✓ Ajuste estacional</span></div></div><div class="visual"><div class="globe"><div class="meridian"></div><div class="horizon"></div><div class="sun"></div><div class="moon"></div></div><div class="pin">📍 Buenos Aires</div><div class="clock-card"><small>MADRID · AHORA</small><b id="heroTime">20:00</b></div></div></div>
<div class="wrap"><form class="calc" id="calculator"><div class="case-label">¿QUÉ NECESITÁS RESOLVER?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-mode="compare"><span>🌍</span>Comparar ciudades</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="meeting"><span>📞</span>Encontrar horario para hablar</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="flight"><span>✈</span>Calcular llegada de un vuelo</button></div>
<div class="grid"><div class="panel"><h2 id="formTitle">Compará dos ciudades</h2><p class="hint" id="formHint">Vemos la hora local y la diferencia en este momento.</p>
<div class="fields active" data-fields="compare"><div class="field"><label>Ciudad de origen</label><select class="control origin"></select></div><button type="button" class="swap" title="Intercambiar ciudades">⇄</button><div class="field"><label>Ciudad de destino</label><select class="control destination"></select></div></div>
<div class="fields" data-fields="meeting"><div class="field"><label>Tu ciudad</label><select class="control origin"></select></div><button type="button" class="swap" title="Intercambiar ciudades">⇄</button><div class="field"><label>Ciudad de la otra persona</label><select class="control destination"></select></div><div class="extra"><div class="field"><label>Fecha</label><input class="control" id="meetingDate" type="date" value="2026-07-28"></div><div class="field"><label>Hora en tu ciudad</label><input class="control" id="meetingTime" type="time" value="10:00"></div></div></div>
<div class="fields" data-fields="flight"><div class="field"><label>Ciudad de salida</label><select class="control origin"></select></div><button type="button" class="swap" title="Intercambiar ciudades">⇄</button><div class="field"><label>Ciudad de llegada</label><select class="control destination"></select></div><div class="extra"><div class="field"><label>Salida local</label><input class="control" id="flightDate" type="datetime-local" value="2026-07-28T12:00"></div><div class="field"><label>Duración del vuelo</label><input class="control" id="duration" type="text" value="12:30" placeholder="hh:mm"></div></div></div>
<div class="presets"><button type="button" class="preset" data-a="America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires" data-b="Europe/Madrid">Buenos Aires → Madrid</button><button type="button" class="preset" data-a="America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires" data-b="America/New_York">Buenos Aires → Nueva York</button><button type="button" class="preset" data-a="America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires" data-b="Asia/Tokyo">Buenos Aires → Tokio</button></div><button class="update" id="updateButton" type="button">Actualizar horario</button></div>
<div class="panel result"><div class="kicker" id="kicker">DIFERENCIA HORARIA AHORA</div><div class="big" id="resultValue">Madrid está 5 h adelante</div><div class="sub" id="resultSub">Cuando en Buenos Aires son las 15:00, en Madrid son las 20:00.</div><div class="badge" id="resultBadge">Mismo día calendario</div><div class="tiles"><div class="tile"><small id="t1l">Buenos Aires</small><strong id="t1v">15:00</strong></div><div class="tile"><small id="t2l">Madrid</small><strong id="t2v">20:00</strong></div><div class="tile"><small id="t3l">Diferencia</small><strong id="t3v">+5 horas</strong></div></div></div></div></form></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Un día compartido</div><h2>Detectá el cruce cómodo de un vistazo.</h2><p>Verde es horario laboral. Azul oscuro es madrugada. El mejor momento es cuando ambos están despiertos.</p></div><div class="day-grid"><article class="day-card"><div class="city-row"><h3 id="dayCityA">Buenos Aires</h3><b id="dayTimeA">15:00</b></div><div class="timeline" id="timelineA"></div><div class="zone-note" id="zoneA">UTC−3 · sin cambio estacional</div></article><article class="day-card"><div class="city-row"><h3 id="dayCityB">Madrid</h3><b id="dayTimeB">20:00</b></div><div class="timeline" id="timelineB"></div><div class="zone-note" id="zoneB">UTC+2 · horario de verano</div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="explainer"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Lo que suele generar errores</div><h2>No siempre son “cinco horas”.</h2></div><div class="cards"><article class="info"><i>☀️</i><h3>Horario de verano</h3><p>Algunos países adelantan el reloj y la diferencia cambia durante el año.</p></article><article class="info"><i>📅</i><h3>Cambio de fecha</h3><p>Un vuelo o una llamada puede caer en el día anterior o siguiente en destino.</p></article><article class="info"><i>🛬</i><h3>Hora de llegada</h3><p>Sumamos la duración al instante de salida y recién después lo mostramos en la zona de destino.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="dark"><div class="wrap dark-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">La cuenta detrás del reloj</div><h2>Un instante, dos horas locales.</h2><div class="formula"><strong>Hora destino = instante UTC + huso destino</strong><p>Usamos zonas IANA para contemplar automáticamente los ajustes estacionales de cada ciudad.</p></div></div><div class="checks"><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Compara la hora actual de dos ciudades.</span></div><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Convierte una hora propuesta para coordinar llamadas.</span></div><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Calcula llegada local y cambio de día en vuelos.</span></div><div class="check"><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Permite intercambiar origen y destino.</span></div></div></div></section>
`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-hora-mundial')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-hora-mundial');

const cities={"America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires":"Buenos Aires","America/Santiago":"Santiago","America/Sao_Paulo":"São Paulo","America/Lima":"Lima","America/Bogota":"Bogotá","America/Mexico_City":"Ciudad de México","America/New_York":"Nueva York","America/Los_Angeles":"Los Ángeles","Europe/Madrid":"Madrid","Europe/London":"Londres","Europe/Paris":"París","Asia/Dubai":"Dubái","Asia/Kolkata":"Nueva Delhi","Asia/Bangkok":"Bangkok","Asia/Tokyo":"Tokio","Australia/Sydney":"Sídney"};
const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id),set=(id,v)=>$(id).textContent=v;let mode="compare";const cfg={compare:["Compará dos ciudades","Vemos la hora local y la diferencia en este momento."],meeting:["Coordiná una llamada","Elegí una hora en tu ciudad y traducimos el momento para la otra persona."],flight:["Calculá la llegada local","Sumamos la duración y contemplamos el huso y el cambio de fecha."]};
function fill(){root.querySelectorAll(".origin,.destination").forEach(s=>{s.innerHTML=Object.entries(cities).map(([z,n])=>`<option value="${z}">${n}</option>`).join("");s.value=s.classList.contains("origin")?"America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires":"Europe/Madrid"})}function zoneParts(date,zone){let p=Object.fromEntries(new Intl.DateTimeFormat("en-CA",{timeZone:zone,year:"numeric",month:"2-digit",day:"2-digit",hour:"2-digit",minute:"2-digit",hourCycle:"h23"}).formatToParts(date).map(x=>[x.type,x.value]));return{y:+p.year,m:+p.month,d:+p.day,h:+p.hour,min:+p.minute}}function offset(date,zone){let p=zoneParts(date,zone);return(Math.floor(Date.UTC(p.y,p.m-1,p.d,p.h,p.min)/60000)-Math.floor(date.getTime()/60000))}function localDate(str,zone){let [date,time]=str.split("T"),[y,m,d]=date.split("-").map(Number),[h,min]=time.split(":").map(Number),guess=new Date(Date.UTC(y,m-1,d,h,min));return new Date(guess.getTime()-offset(guess,zone)*60000)}function hm(date,zone){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat("es-AR",{timeZone:zone,hour:"2-digit",minute:"2-digit",hourCycle:"h23"}).format(date)}function day(date,zone){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat("es-AR",{timeZone:zone,weekday:"long",day:"numeric",month:"short"}).format(date)}function signed(n){return(n>=0?"+":"−")+Math.abs(n)}function current(){let f=root.querySelector(`.fields[data-fields="${mode}"]`);return{a:f.querySelector(".origin").value,b:f.querySelector(".destination").value}}function sync(a,b){root.querySelectorAll(".origin").forEach(x=>x.value=a);root.querySelectorAll(".destination").forEach(x=>x.value=b)}function drawTimeline(id,zone,ref){let base=zoneParts(ref,zone),html="";for(let h=0;h<24;h+=3){let c=h>=9&&h<18?"work":h<6||h>=22?"sleep":"";html+=`<div class="hour ${c}">${String(h).padStart(2,"0")}h</div>`}$(id).innerHTML=html;return base}
function calculate(){let{a,b}=current(),now=new Date(),oa=offset(now,a),ob=offset(now,b),diff=(ob-oa)/60,ref=now;if(mode==="meeting"){ref=localDate($("meetingDate").value+"T"+$("meetingTime").value,a)}if(mode==="flight"){let dep=localDate($("flightDate").value,a),[dh,dm]=($("duration").value||"0:0").split(":").map(Number);ref=new Date(dep.getTime()+((dh||0)*60+(dm||0))*60000)}let at=hm(ref,a),bt=hm(ref,b),pa=zoneParts(ref,a),pb=zoneParts(ref,b),dayDelta=Math.round((Date.UTC(pb.y,pb.m-1,pb.d)-Date.UTC(pa.y,pa.m-1,pa.d))/86400000),dayLabel=dayDelta===0?"Mismo día calendario":dayDelta>0?`En destino es ${dayDelta===1?"el día siguiente":dayDelta+" días después"}`:`En destino es ${dayDelta===-1?"el día anterior":Math.abs(dayDelta)+" días antes"}`,nameA=cities[a],nameB=cities[b];if(mode==="compare"){set("kicker","DIFERENCIA HORARIA AHORA");set("resultValue",diff===0?"Tienen la misma hora":`${nameB} está ${Math.abs(diff)} h ${diff>0?"adelante":"atrás"}`);set("resultSub",`Cuando en ${nameA} son las ${at}, en ${nameB} son las ${bt}.`)}if(mode==="meeting"){let bh=zoneParts(ref,b).h,good=bh>=9&&bh<18;set("kicker","HORA DE LA LLAMADA EN DESTINO");set("resultValue",`${bt} en ${nameB}`);set("resultSub",`${at} en ${nameA} · ${day(ref,b)}.`);dayLabel=good?"Dentro del horario laboral":bh>=7&&bh<22?"Fuera del horario laboral":"En destino es de madrugada"}if(mode==="flight"){set("kicker","LLEGADA LOCAL ESTIMADA");set("resultValue",`${bt} en ${nameB}`);set("resultSub",`${day(ref,b)} · saliendo desde ${nameA}.`)}set("resultBadge",dayLabel);set("t1l",nameA);set("t1v",at);set("t2l",nameB);set("t2v",bt);set("t3l","Diferencia");set("t3v",diff===0?"Misma hora":signed(diff)+" horas");set("heroTime",bt);set("dayCityA",nameA);set("dayCityB",nameB);set("dayTimeA",at);set("dayTimeB",bt);drawTimeline("timelineA",a,ref);drawTimeline("timelineB",b,ref);set("zoneA",`UTC${signed(oa/60)} · ${day(ref,a)}`);set("zoneB",`UTC${signed(ob/60)} · ${day(ref,b)}`)}
fill();root.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{mode=b.dataset.mode;root.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));root.querySelectorAll(".fields").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x.dataset.fields===mode));set("formTitle",cfg[mode][0]);set("formHint",cfg[mode][1]);calculate()}));root.querySelectorAll(".swap").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{let{a,b}=current();sync(b,a);calculate()}));root.querySelectorAll(".preset").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{sync(b.dataset.a,b.dataset.b);calculate()}));root.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));function confirmCalc(){calculate();set("updateButton","✓ Horario actualizado");clearTimeout(window.confirmTimer);window.confirmTimer=setTimeout(()=>set("updateButton","Actualizar horario"),5000)}$("updateButton").addEventListener("click",confirmCalc);$("calculator").addEventListener("submit",e=>{e.preventDefault();confirmCalc()});calculate();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-hora-mundial{--ink:#101a32;--muted:#667286;--line:#dfe4ea;--bg:#f7f7f3;--blue:#286be7;--mint:#32ad9a;--amber:#f0ae45;--navy:#0e2645}.mockup-hora-mundial *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-hora-mundial{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.5 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}.mockup-hora-mundial .wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.mockup-hora-mundial header{height:86px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-hora-mundial .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}.mockup-hora-mundial .logo{width:28px;height:35px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center}.mockup-hora-mundial .brand{font-size:18px;font-weight:950}.mockup-hora-mundial .links{display:flex;gap:24px;color:#4e5a6c;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-hora-mundial .tools{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px}.mockup-hora-mundial .tool{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:11px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:800}.mockup-hora-mundial .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;padding:62px 0 48px}.mockup-hora-mundial .crumb{color:var(--blue);font-size:14px}.mockup-hora-mundial .eyebrow{margin-top:18px;color:#197c76;font-size:12px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}.mockup-hora-mundial h1{font-size:clamp(46px,5.2vw,70px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:11px 0 20px}.mockup-hora-mundial .lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-hora-mundial .chips{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-hora-mundial .chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:8px 13px;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}
.mockup-hora-mundial .visual{height:350px;position:relative}.mockup-hora-mundial .globe{position:absolute;width:285px;height:285px;border-radius:50%;left:75px;top:20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#173e6b 0 50%,#f0b24f 50% 100%);box-shadow:0 25px 60px #1c304e2b;overflow:hidden}.mockup-hora-mundial .globe:before,.mockup-hora-mundial .globe:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:3px solid #ffffff55;border-radius:50%}.mockup-hora-mundial .globe:before{inset:28px 75px}.mockup-hora-mundial .globe:after{inset:75px 22px}.mockup-hora-mundial .meridian{position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;border-left:3px solid #ffffff55}.mockup-hora-mundial .horizon{position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;right:0;border-top:3px solid #ffffff55}.mockup-hora-mundial .sun{position:absolute;width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff2b4;right:47px;top:56px;box-shadow:0 0 0 12px #fff1ad22}.mockup-hora-mundial .moon{position:absolute;width:39px;height:39px;border-radius:50%;background:#eef5ff;left:47px;bottom:56px;box-shadow:inset -12px -4px #b8c7df}.mockup-hora-mundial .clock-card{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:18px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:0 16px 35px #26384d22}.mockup-hora-mundial .clock-card small{display:block;color:#758195;font-size:10px;font-weight:900}.mockup-hora-mundial .clock-card b{font-size:27px}.mockup-hora-mundial .pin{position:absolute;left:20px;top:58px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px 15px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px #26384d1d;font-weight:900}
.mockup-hora-mundial .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 26px 70px #26354e13;margin-bottom:68px}.mockup-hora-mundial .case-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:950;color:#5b6778;margin-bottom:11px}.mockup-hora-mundial .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:25px}.mockup-hora-mundial .case{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fafbfc;padding:13px;color:#505d70;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-hora-mundial .case span{display:block;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:3px}.mockup-hora-mundial .case.active{background:#eef4ff;color:#1c5fcd;border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--blue)}.mockup-hora-mundial .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr;gap:23px}.mockup-hora-mundial .panel{background:#fafbfc;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:20px;padding:24px}.mockup-hora-mundial .panel h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-hora-mundial .hint{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px}.mockup-hora-mundial .fields{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 52px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:end}.mockup-hora-mundial .fields.active{display:grid}.mockup-hora-mundial .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-hora-mundial .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-hora-mundial .control{width:100%;height:50px;border:1px solid #cad3dd;border-radius:11px;background:#fff;padding:0 13px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:750}.mockup-hora-mundial .swap{height:50px;border:1px solid #cad3dd;border-radius:11px;background:#fff;font-size:19px;cursor:pointer}.mockup-hora-mundial .extra{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-hora-mundial .update{width:100%;height:53px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:950;margin-top:20px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 22px #1e67e82c}.mockup-hora-mundial .presets{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:13px}.mockup-hora-mundial .preset{border:1px solid #d8dee7;background:#fff;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-hora-mundial .result{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#13365f,#0b1e3b);border:0;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.mockup-hora-mundial .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:220px;height:220px;border:45px solid #2ab6aa20;border-radius:50%;right:-125px;bottom:-130px}.mockup-hora-mundial .kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#9fe1d6;font-weight:950}.mockup-hora-mundial .big{font-size:42px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:15px 0 7px}.mockup-hora-mundial .sub{color:#c2d2e4}.mockup-hora-mundial .badge{display:inline-flex;margin-top:16px;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:99px;background:#1e4777;border:1px solid #416992;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.mockup-hora-mundial .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-hora-mundial .tile{background:#ffffff0c;border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;position:relative;z-index:1}.mockup-hora-mundial .tile small{display:block;color:#b6c7db;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.07em}.mockup-hora-mundial .tile strong{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:14px}
.mockup-hora-mundial section{padding:70px 0}.mockup-hora-mundial .section-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.mockup-hora-mundial .section-head h2,.mockup-hora-mundial .dark h2{font-size:39px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0}.mockup-hora-mundial .section-head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-hora-mundial .day-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.mockup-hora-mundial .day-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:21px;padding:23px}.mockup-hora-mundial .city-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:17px}.mockup-hora-mundial .city-row h3{font-size:22px;margin:0}.mockup-hora-mundial .city-row b{font-size:27px}.mockup-hora-mundial .timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px}.mockup-hora-mundial .hour{height:48px;border-radius:7px;background:#e9eef4;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:10px;color:#657186}.mockup-hora-mundial .hour.work{background:#d7f0e9;color:#156c5c;font-weight:900}.mockup-hora-mundial .hour.sleep{background:#1c3557;color:#d9e6f5}.mockup-hora-mundial .zone-note{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.mockup-hora-mundial .explainer{background:#eef3f5;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-hora-mundial .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}.mockup-hora-mundial .info{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:21px}.mockup-hora-mundial .info i{font-style:normal;font-size:25px}.mockup-hora-mundial .info h3{margin:11px 0 6px}.mockup-hora-mundial .info p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:0}.mockup-hora-mundial .dark{background:#0c203d;color:#fff}.mockup-hora-mundial .dark-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px}.mockup-hora-mundial .formula{border:1px solid #ffffff20;background:#ffffff09;border-radius:20px;padding:24px}.mockup-hora-mundial .formula strong{font-size:25px}.mockup-hora-mundial .formula p{color:#b8c9dc}.mockup-hora-mundial .checks{display:grid;gap:12px}.mockup-hora-mundial .check{display:flex;gap:12px;color:#d4e0ee}.mockup-hora-mundial .tick{flex:0 0 26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:#2eaa98;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#071d2c;font-weight:950}.mockup-hora-mundial footer{padding:30px;text-align:center;color:#687589;font-size:12px;background:#fff}
@media(max-width:920px){.mockup-hora-mundial .links{display:none}.mockup-hora-mundial .hero,.mockup-hora-mundial .grid,.mockup-hora-mundial .day-grid,.mockup-hora-mundial .dark-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-hora-mundial .visual{height:330px}.mockup-hora-mundial .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-hora-mundial .tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.mockup-hora-mundial .wrap{width:calc(100% - 24px)}.mockup-hora-mundial header{height:70px}.mockup-hora-mundial .tools .tool:first-child{display:none}.mockup-hora-mundial h1{font-size:42px}.mockup-hora-mundial .visual{transform:scale(.84);margin:-30px}.mockup-hora-mundial .calc{padding:14px}.mockup-hora-mundial .panel{padding:17px}.mockup-hora-mundial .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-hora-mundial .fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 44px 1fr}.mockup-hora-mundial .extra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-hora-mundial .section-head h2,.mockup-hora-mundial .dark h2{font-size:32px}}

.mockup-hora-mundial { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .top, .mockup-hora-mundial header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real p { color:#687a8f; line-height:1.65; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-hora-mundial .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-hora-mundial support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
